data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"group\": {\n      \"platform\": \"facebook\",\n      \"id\": \"109977656368235\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/109977656368235\",\n      \"name\": \"Educating Parents of HS Athletes On The College Recruiting Process\",\n      \"description\": \"Having been a college coach for 14 years, HS varsity coach for 3 years, NCAA Compliance Director, and author of the book, \\\"Looking For A FULL RIDE: An Insider's Recruiting Guide\\\", I am here to help you understand the recruiting process for your student athlete. For my book, I have interviewed over 65 college coaches and athletic directors across 19 different sports in all levels of college sports across the USA. I speak all across the country doing recruiting seminars for high school and club sports as well as have some clients in consulting for their families specifically.  For more information, email me at info@lookingforafullride.com. \\n\\nI ask that there are no political, self-promotion, promotion of your businesses (unless they are partnered with RL Academy, LLC) or negative conversations within this group. We are here to support each other only please. This group is not associated with NCSA, NSR, ScholarshipsUSA, CaptainU, etc, or other recruiting services. (We actually are against using recruiting services). I run my own company where I do seminars throughout the country at high schools & sports organizations, as well as consulting with individual families. I will not endorse any of those recruiting services, as most college coaches do not like the mass emailing that happens through many of these services. I help educate families on what they should be doing for themselves to get recruited, as opposed to what many services claim to do for you. If you want to learn how, please join us. If you want to tell us how great these services are, this is not the right group for you. \\n\\nAll members must be approved as well as all group postings.\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2017-08-09T00:54:47.000Z\",\n      \"historySummary\": \"Group created on August 9, 2017. Name last changed on October 28, 2018.\",\n      \"privacy\": {\n        \"label\": \"Private\",\n        \"description\": \"Only members can see who's in the group and what they post.\"\n      },\n      \"visibility\": {\n        \"label\": \"Visible\",\n        \"description\": \"Anyone can find this group.\"\n      },\n      \"categories\": [],\n      \"memberCount\": 270585,\n      \"administratorCount\": 0,\n      \"moderatorCount\": 0,\n      \"administrators\": [],\n      \"moderators\": [],\n      \"activity\": {\n        \"postsLastDay\": 8,\n        \"postsLastMonth\": 265,\n        \"newMembersText\": \"No new members in the last week\"\n      },\n      \"rules\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824786650176\",\n          \"title\": \"We will create a positive community. No swearing.\",\n          \"description\": \"Be encouraging & kind. No complaining, venting, negative comments. Bullying isn't allowed. Degrading comments about things like race, religion, culture, sexual orientation, gender, etc will not be tolerated. We don't allow political/controversial topics (vaccines, etc) to be discussed. Due to the size of our group, we receive 30+posts/day, we will close comments on posts. You can always resubmit ? if u need further info from our experts. If u say nasty comments about admin team, u will be banned\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824789983509\",\n          \"title\": \"No promos(NO recruiting services) or 3rd party.\",\n          \"description\": \"WE DO NOT ENDORSE ANY 3rd PARTY CAMPS, EVENTS, TOURNEYS, or BUSINESSES. (Go to individual college camps- not 3rd party \\\"camps\\\".) Self-promo, spam & outside links aren't allowed here. Only our approved partnerships are allowed to promote here. We NEVER endorse using any recruiting services. Your teen should be using gmail/yahoo & youtube to contact coaches- not a 3rd party. Many recruiting services will contact you like crazy-you don't need them. Only need this group & lookingforafullride.com\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373858849980103\",\n          \"title\": \"Please use the search bar! (Lots of same ? weekly)\",\n          \"description\": \"We respectfully encourage the use of our group search bar, located at the top of the page, before posting a question for consideration. We get A LOT of the same questions each week!\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824793316842\",\n          \"title\": \"Please see the resources at rlopezcoaching.com.\",\n          \"description\": \"We have 20+ FREE digital resources at rlopezcoaching.com (under the store). The book describes the entire recruiting process (we do not release a digital or audio version of the book). We do not sell the book at 3rd party retailers (they are just trying to scam you). Only purchase at rlopezcoaching.com\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824796650175\",\n          \"title\": \"We are not a crowdsourcing group.\",\n          \"description\": \"Our group's purpose is to educate parents/families, coaches & school counselors. We do not encourage crowdsourcing for opinions, as we have experts in recruiting education to provide the correct & factual information for our group. If you would prefer a crowdsourcing group, there are many others on FB for that purpose, ours is not one of them. Due to the size of this group & getting 30-50 posts a day & we will close comments on threads to ensure facts, not opinions, are provided to the group)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373855893313732\",\n          \"title\": \"We don’t discuss specific colleges/univ, nor HS.\",\n          \"description\": \"We don’t allow specific colleges/universities to be mentioned in the group EXCEPT when a student-athlete commits. Parents may post a celebratory commitment post in honor of their student-athlete. We also do NOT get involved of choosing a specific High School to attend as we could not possibly know all of the factors involved regarding coaches or academic programs. Recruiting is not about playing for XYZ travel or hs team. It is about how you market yourself- see www.lookingforafullride.com\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824783316843\",\n          \"title\": \"Eligibility & Transfers\",\n          \"description\": \"Each Hs district has their own NCAA designations regarding coursework. All specific ? regarding NCAA/NAIA courses & eligibility need to go directly to that governing body (M-F bus hrs). All ? regarding 4 year to 4 year transfers, need to be addressed w/college compliance staff as those are all case specific & involve transfer portal. There are college staff who handle these situations. We also do NOT endorse HS RECLASSIFICATION except for ACADEMIC REASONS.(GO JUCO if need a year to develop)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373858846646770\",\n          \"title\": \"No anonymous/nickname/without grad year/sport.\",\n          \"description\": \"We respect transparency in our group and will not allow anonymous posts. Please do not DM Coach Renee directly with your question, or request to remain anonymous. Also, all questions need to have a graduation year and sport included as that often dictates much of our Admin team's advice.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1373824779983510\",\n          \"title\": \"We don’t allow video/profile of student-athletes\",\n          \"description\": \"For privacy reasons, no videos/profiles of your student-athletes will be permitted. College coaches are not in here evaluating athletes. Please do NOT dm our team to evaluate your film.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"1383783925654262\",\n          \"title\": \"Please check DM (admins answering privately)\",\n          \"description\": \"Please look under your Message Requests (in your Facebook Message folder). This can be initiated by our admin team because the question needs to addressed privately. Please do NOT initiate DMs to our admin team.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_1e8278ff-0a5f-424f-ab8e-1142052be997\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a7-a926-70f4-b942-e30346e1ee9c\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","group":{"platform":"facebook","id":"109977656368235","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/109977656368235","name":"Educating Parents of HS Athletes On The College Recruiting Process","description":"Having been a college coach for 14 years, HS varsity coach for 3 years, NCAA Compliance Director, and author of the book, \"Looking For A FULL RIDE: An Insider's Recruiting Guide\", I am here to help you understand the recruiting process for your student athlete. For my book, I have interviewed over 65 college coaches and athletic directors across 19 different sports in all levels of college sports across the USA. I speak all across the country doing recruiting seminars for high school and club sports as well as have some clients in consulting for their families specifically.  For more information, email me at info@lookingforafullride.com. \n\nI ask that there are no political, self-promotion, promotion of your businesses (unless they are partnered with RL Academy, LLC) or negative conversations within this group. We are here to support each other only please. This group is not associated with NCSA, NSR, ScholarshipsUSA, CaptainU, etc, or other recruiting services. (We actually are against using recruiting services). I run my own company where I do seminars throughout the country at high schools & sports organizations, as well as consulting with individual families. I will not endorse any of those recruiting services, as most college coaches do not like the mass emailing t