any recruiting services will contact you like crazy-you don't need them. Only need this group & lookingforafullride.com"},{"id":"1373858849980103","title":"Please use the search bar! (Lots of same ? weekly)","description":"We respectfully encourage the use of our group search bar, located at the top of the page, before posting a question for consideration. We get A LOT of the same questions each week!"},{"id":"1373824793316842","title":"Please see the resources at rlopezcoaching.com.","description":"We have 20+ FREE digital resources at rlopezcoaching.com (under the store). The book describes the entire recruiting process (we do not release a digital or audio version of the book). We do not sell the book at 3rd party retailers (they are just trying to scam you). Only purchase at rlopezcoaching.com"},{"id":"1373824796650175","title":"We are not a crowdsourcing group.","description":"Our group's purpose is to educate parents/families, coaches & school counselors. We do not encourage crowdsourcing for opinions, as we have experts in recruiting education to provide the correct & factual information for our group. If you would prefer a crowdsourcing group, there are many others on FB for that purpose, ours is not one of them. Due to the size of this group & getting 30-50 posts a day & we will close comments on threads to ensure facts, not opinions, are provided to the group)"},{"id":"1373855893313732","title":"We don’t discuss specific colleges/univ, nor HS.","description":"We don’t allow specific colleges/universities to be mentioned in the group EXCEPT when a student-athlete commits. Parents may post a celebratory commitment post in honor of their student-athlete. We also do NOT get involved of choosing a specific High School to attend as we could not possibly know all of the factors involved regarding coaches or academic programs. Recruiting is not about playing for XYZ travel or hs team. It is about how you market yourself- see www.lookingforafullride.com"},{"id":"13